  "independentSourceReview": [
    "完整e601内联callback与当前新owner实际正文逐句核对：七解构context字段读取顺序world/actorId/role/toolCall/day/abilityId/phase保；activeNightAbility先库存status，随后phase/name/Scholar/Alive/终身policy/Lucky，同三个target getter与每个day??1晚使用点，原错误/抛异常短路保。",
    "Registry buildDefaultRules先两次profile.validationRules读取并Object.assign捕获callback；validate在当前role/catalog/runtime/validationRules/toolName原点晚lookup，缺同名则构造fallback，实际rule裸调用receiver不变；新同一表保持可写，不误称深freeze或统一late缓存。",
    "activeNightAbility仍按真实库存选择native或唯一明确gift；规则没有Role.Seer标签/native来源新门槛。seerTargetAllowed原state/history读取，luckyTargetAllowed原actor本地histories与activation/当前inventory判断均未复制；Scholar resolved查询在目标前，未settled原错误传播。",
    "Seer阶段的legalTargets/requiresAction、native/lucky/black-market槽、scope与生命复验、mapped/reflected targets、状态/use/Fox/历史/事件付费前缀原owner全保，本rule输出不提交或授予许可。profile配置/init/mock/tool/night/presentation其余全程序原样，原仍使用的三个查询imports保。",
    "七运行binding实际端点逐路源码核：Scholar ports→night_frame函数同binding、Seer query为ports原函数、Phase/RuleError中立identity/errors、Alive/contracts、abilities、night_action_history。新ToolRuleMap纯类型，无额外runtime API/barrel。",
    "3新unit完整读：table identity/getter late vsfallback、真实nonSeer grant/本地history无付款、context和3target字面trace/阶段早拒/第二getter抛错；finally恢复自有descriptor，expected非生产callback导出。",
    "有限static图148→151/owner108为作者捕获共同依赖，新增owner+Scholar ports/lifecycle，实际edges不回profile或owner；无dynamic/完整历史图承诺。当前后继Inventory API WIP明确排除，新unit旧grant路线留该层的后继迁移。",
    "中文head/关键comment准确区分准入和提交/付款；同可写table≠Registry全局fallback晚绑定；目标3读、削弱早于target、历史不重置与阶段actualscope/life说明均对应实际代码。未把oldScholar端口英文头强行当本批触及source。"
  ],
